{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And you came to this place.</b> Now you see yourselves in greatness and glory — do not kick against the Omnipresent, and let your heart not be lifted up. <b>And you shall keep the words of this covenant</b> — another interpretation: <b>And YHWH has not given you a heart to know</b> — for a person does not grasp the full depth of his master's knowledge and the wisdom of his learning until forty years, and therefore the Omnipresent did not hold you strictly accountable until this day; but from here onward He will hold you accountable, and therefore <b>and you shall keep the words of this covenant</b> etc. (Avodah Zarah 5)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:48:46.616103167Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}